## CloudImaging .gitignore
## .NET + Node.js + WPF + Bicep + Azure Functions

# -------
# .NET
# -------
**/bin/
**/obj/
artifacts/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
*.userprefs
TestResults/
coverage/
*.ncrunch*
*_ReSharper*
*.DotSettings.user

# -------
# .NET publish output (dotnet publish / deploy staging — never source)
# -------
publish/
**/publish/

# -------
# Node.js / TypeScript
# -------
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.cache/
**/.parcel-cache/
**/coverage/
**/.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo

# -------
# Environment / Secrets — NEVER commit these
# -------
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.production
**/.env.*.local
local.settings.json
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json

# -------
# Azure Functions local settings
# -------
local.settings.json

# -------
# Bicep / ARM
# -------
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars

# -------
# OS / IDE
# -------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.tmp
*.log
.idea/
*.iml

# -------
# Downloaded Azure App Service logs
# -------
portal-logs/
portal-logs.zip

# -------
# Portal backend deploy artifacts (generated by the deploy task/pipeline)
# -------
src/cloud-imaging-portal/server/deploy-portal-backend.zip
src/cloud-imaging-portal/server/deploy-pkg/

# -------
# VS Code workspace-specific (developer-local only)
# -------
.vscode/settings.json
.vscode/launch.json
.vscode/tasks.json
*.code-workspace

# Compiled Vite/TS output (not source files)
src/cloud-imaging-portal/client/src/**/*.js
src/cloud-imaging-portal/client/vite.config.js
src/cloud-imaging-portal/client/vite.config.d.ts

# -------
# UI design mockups (local design exploration, not shipped source)
# -------
docs/design/
